{"seq":2,"slug":"traceql-query","title":"TraceQL 查询语言与指标分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/analysis/traceql-query","wordCount":915,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"traceql-查询语言与指标分析\">TraceQL 查询语言与指标分析</h1><p>TraceQL 是 Grafana Tempo 专为分布式追踪设计的查询语言，填补了传统追踪系统&quot;只能按 TraceID 精确查找&quot;的能力空白。它允许工程师以声明式语法表达复杂的链路查询条件——跨 Span 的属性过滤、结构化的父子/兄弟关系匹配、以及直接从 Trace 数据派生出时序指标。随着 Tempo 3.0 将 TraceQL Metrics 推向 GA，追踪数据不再只是故障排查工具，而成为了一个实时分析引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TraceQL 的设计哲学是&quot;以 Span 集合为操作对象&quot;——每个查询返回的不是单条记录而是一组满足条件的 Span Set（跨度集），然后通过管道操作（过滤、聚合、结构匹配）逐步精炼。这与 SQL 操作行集、PromQL 操作时序的思路一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"traceql-基础语法\">TraceQL 基础语法</h2><p>TraceQL 的基本单元是 <strong>span 选择器</strong>（spanset），用花括号包围条件表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{ &lt;condition&gt; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{ &#x3C;condition> }</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法元素</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>{ }</code></td>\n<td>匹配所有 Span</td>\n<td>全量扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ span.attr = &quot;val&quot; }</code></td>\n<td>匹配 Span 属性</td>\n<td><code>{ span.http.method = &quot;POST&quot; }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ resource.attr = &quot;val&quot; }</code></td>\n<td>匹配 Resource 属性</td>\n<td><code>{ resource.service.name = &quot;payment&quot; }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ status = error }</code></td>\n<td>匹配状态</td>\n<td>所有错误 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ duration &gt; 1s }</code></td>\n<td>匹配持续时间</td>\n<td>慢 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{ name = &quot;GET /api/*&quot; }</code></td>\n<td>匹配 Span 名称</td>\n<td>通配符支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"内置属性-intrinsics\">内置属性（Intrinsics）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内置属性</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>duration</code></td>\n<td>duration</td>\n<td>Span 持续时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>Span 操作名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>unset / ok / error</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>kind</code></td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td>client / server / producer / consumer / internal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rootName</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>所属 Trace 的 Root Span 名称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rootServiceName</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>Root Span 的 service.name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>traceDuration</code></td>\n<td>duration</td>\n<td>整条 Trace 的总持续时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>span.parentID</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>父 Span ID（Tempo 2.8+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"结构化查询-管道操作\">结构化查询：管道操作</h2><p>TraceQL 使用管道操作符 <code>|</code> 串联多个过滤和聚合步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{ &lt;spanset&gt; } | &lt;pipeline stage&gt; | &lt;pipeline stage&gt; ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{ &#x3C;spanset> } | &#x3C;pipeline stage> | &#x3C;pipeline stage> ...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"跨-span-关系操作符\">跨 Span 关系操作符</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Operators[&quot;结构化操作符&quot;]&#10;        SEQ[&quot;&gt; &gt; 祖先-后代&lt;br/&gt;(ancestor-descendant)&quot;]&#10;        CHILD[&quot;&gt; 父-子&lt;br/&gt;(parent-child)&quot;]&#10;        SIB[&quot;~ 兄弟&lt;br/&gt;(sibling)&quot;]&#10;        AND[&quot;&amp; &amp; 同一 Trace&lt;br/&gt;(coexist)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Operators[\"结构化操作符\"]\n        SEQ[\"&gt; &gt; 祖先-后代&lt;br/&gt;(ancestor-descendant)\"]\n        CHILD[\"&gt; 父-子&lt;br/&gt;(parent-child)\"]\n        SIB[\"~ 兄弟&lt;br/&gt;(sibling)\"]\n        AND[\"&amp; &amp; 同一 Trace&lt;br/&gt;(coexist)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>A 是 B 的祖先（任意深度）</td>\n<td><code>{ span.http.method = &quot;POST&quot; } &gt;&gt; { status = error }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&gt;</code></td>\n<td>A 是 B 的直接父</td>\n<td><code>{ name = &quot;HTTP GET&quot; } &gt; { span.db.system = &quot;postgresql&quot; }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~</code></td>\n<td>A 和 B 是兄弟（同一父 Span）</td>\n<td><code>{ span.db.system = &quot;redis&quot; } ~ { span.db.system = &quot;postgresql&quot; }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;&amp;</code></td>\n<td>A 和 B 存在于同一 Trace 中</td>\n<td><code>{ resource.service.name = &quot;auth&quot; } &amp;&amp; { status = error }</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实战示例——找到&quot;POST 请求导致数据库错误&quot;的完整链路：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{ span.http.method = &quot;POST&quot; &amp;&amp; resource.service.name = &quot;order-service&quot; }&#10;  &gt;&gt; { span.db.system = &quot;postgresql&quot; &amp;&amp; status = error }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{ span.http.method = \"POST\" &#x26;&#x26; resource.service.name = \"order-service\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  >> { span.db.system = \"postgresql\" &#x26;&#x26; status = error }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"聚合与过滤函数\">聚合与过滤函数</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>count()</code></td>\n<td>spanset</td>\n<td>匹配 Span 的数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>avg(field)</code></td>\n<td>spanset</td>\n<td>字段平均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max(field)</code></td>\n<td>spanset</td>\n<td>字段最大值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min(field)</code></td>\n<td>spanset</td>\n<td>字段最小值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sum(field)</code></td>\n<td>spanset</td>\n<td>字段求和</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到包含超过 50 个 Span 的 Trace&#10;{ } | count() &gt; 50&#10;&#10;// 找到平均 Span 时长超过 500ms 的 Trace&#10;{ } | avg(duration) &gt; 500ms&#10;&#10;// 找到某 Trace 中数据库操作总耗时超过 2s&#10;{ span.db.system = &quot;postgresql&quot; } | sum(duration) &gt; 2s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到包含超过 50 个 Span 的 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | count() > 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到平均 Span 时长超过 500ms 的 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | avg(duration) > 500ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到某 Trace 中数据库操作总耗时超过 2s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ span.db.system = \"postgresql\" } | sum(duration) > 2s</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"traceql-metrics-运行时指标\">TraceQL Metrics：运行时指标</h2><p>TraceQL Metrics 是 Tempo 3.0 的 GA 特性，直接从追踪数据计算时序指标，无需预聚合的 metrics-generator：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    TRACE[&quot;Trace 数据&lt;br/&gt;(Object Storage)&quot;] --&gt; ENGINE[&quot;TraceQL&lt;br/&gt;Metrics Engine&quot;]&#10;    ENGINE --&gt; TS[&quot;时序结果&quot;]&#10;    TS --&gt; DASH[&quot;Grafana Dashboard&quot;]&#10;    TS --&gt; ALERT[&quot;告警规则&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    TRACE[\"Trace 数据&lt;br/&gt;(Object Storage)\"] --&gt; ENGINE[\"TraceQL&lt;br/&gt;Metrics Engine\"]\n    ENGINE --&gt; TS[\"时序结果\"]\n    TS --&gt; DASH[\"Grafana Dashboard\"]\n    TS --&gt; ALERT[\"告警规则\"]</pre><h3 id=\"一阶聚合函数\">一阶聚合函数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rate()</code></td>\n<td>匹配 Span 的速率</td>\n<td><code>{ status = error } | rate()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>count_over_time()</code></td>\n<td>时间窗口内计数</td>\n<td><code>{ span.http.route = &quot;/api/pay&quot; } | count_over_time()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>avg_over_time(field)</code></td>\n<td>时间窗口内平均</td>\n<td><code>{ } | avg_over_time(duration)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sum_over_time(field)</code></td>\n<td>时间窗口内求和</td>\n<td><code>{ } | sum_over_time(span.http.response_content_length)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min_over_time(field)</code></td>\n<td>时间窗口内最小值</td>\n<td><code>{ } | min_over_time(duration)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_over_time(field)</code></td>\n<td>时间窗口内最大值</td>\n<td><code>{ } | max_over_time(duration)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quantile_over_time(field, q)</code></td>\n<td>分位数</td>\n<td><code>{ } | quantile_over_time(duration, 0.99)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>histogram_over_time(field)</code></td>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td><code>{ } | histogram_over_time(duration)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二阶函数与比较运算符\">二阶函数与比较运算符</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// Top 10 最慢的端点&#10;{ } | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.name) | topk(10)&#10;&#10;// Bottom 5 最少调用的服务&#10;{ } | count_over_time() by (resource.service.name) | bottomk(5)&#10;&#10;// 告警：当错误率超过阈值&#10;{ status = error } | rate() by (resource.service.name) &gt; 0.05\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Top 10 最慢的端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | avg_over_time(duration) by (span.name) | topk(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Bottom 5 最少调用的服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | count_over_time() by (resource.service.name) | bottomk(5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 告警：当错误率超过阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ status = error } | rate() by (resource.service.name) > 0.05</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自适应采样-tempo-3-0\">自适应采样（Tempo 3.0）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 自动选择最优采样率&#10;{ } | rate() with(sample=true)&#10;&#10;// 固定 Span 采样率（10%）&#10;{ } | rate() with(span_sample=0.1)&#10;&#10;// 固定 Trace 采样率&#10;{ } | rate() with(trace_sample=0.05)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 自动选择最优采样率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | rate() with(sample=true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 固定 Span 采样率（10%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | rate() with(span_sample=0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 固定 Trace 采样率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ } | rate() with(trace_sample=0.05)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自适应采样根据匹配密度动态调整：匹配稀少时保持高采样率（接近 100%），匹配密集时降低采样率以控制查询开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战查询模式\">实战查询模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-错误链路定位\">模式一：错误链路定位</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到影响支付流程的错误 Trace&#10;{ resource.service.name = &quot;payment-gateway&quot; &amp;&amp; status = error }&#10;  &gt;&gt; { span.db.system =~ &quot;.*&quot; }&#10;  | count() &gt; 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到影响支付流程的错误 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ resource.service.name = \"payment-gateway\" &#x26;&#x26; status = error }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  >> { span.db.system =~ \".*\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | count() > 1</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式二-延迟热点分析\">模式二：延迟热点分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到 P99 &gt; 5s 的 API 端点&#10;{ kind = server &amp;&amp; span.http.route != &quot;&quot; }&#10;  | quantile_over_time(duration, 0.99) by (span.http.route) &gt; 5s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到 P99 > 5s 的 API 端点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ kind = server &#x26;&#x26; span.http.route != \"\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | quantile_over_time(duration, 0.99) by (span.http.route) > 5s</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式三-服务依赖发现\">模式三：服务依赖发现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 找到调用了外部服务的 Trace&#10;{ kind = client &amp;&amp; resource.service.name = &quot;order-service&quot; }&#10;  | rate() by (span.server.address)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 找到调用了外部服务的 Trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ kind = client &#x26;&#x26; resource.service.name = \"order-service\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | rate() by (span.server.address)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式四-最近错误快速查看\">模式四：最近错误快速查看</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 获取最近的错误 Trace（Tempo 2.8+）&#10;{ status = error } with(most_recent=true)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 获取最近的错误 Trace（Tempo 2.8+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{ status = error } with(most_recent=true)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"query-hint-与性能优化\">Query Hint 与性能优化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hint</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>most_recent=true</code></td>\n<td>返回最新 Trace</td>\n<td>实时排障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sample=true</code></td>\n<td>自适应采样</td>\n<td>大时间范围聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>span_sample=X</code></td>\n<td>固定 Span 采样率</td>\n<td>控制查询成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>spanonly_fetch=true</code></td>\n<td>仅读 Span 数据（实验性）</td>\n<td>加速 metrics 查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TraceQL 通过 spanset 选择器 + 管道操作实现声明式链路查询</li>\n<li>结构化操作符（<code>&gt;&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>~</code>, <code>&amp;&amp;</code>）表达 Span 间的拓扑关系</li>\n<li>Metrics 函数将 Trace 数据转化为时序指标，支持 Dashboard 和告警</li>\n<li>比较运算符（<code>&gt; threshold</code>）是告警基础，配合 <code>rate()</code>/<code>avg_over_time()</code> 实现 SLO 监控</li>\n<li>自适应采样在大数据量下兼顾查询性能和信号质量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"tracing-backends\">追踪后端存储</a>：Tempo/Jaeger 的存储架构与选型</li>\n<li><a href=\"trace-visualization\">追踪可视化与分析</a>：如何将 TraceQL 结果转化为可操作的视觉洞察</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TraceQL 查询语言与指标分析","id":"traceql-查询语言与指标分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TraceQL 基础语法","id":"traceql-基础语法"},{"level":3,"text":"内置属性（Intrinsics）","id":"内置属性-intrinsics"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化查询：管道操作","id":"结构化查询-管道操作"},{"level":3,"text":"跨 Span 关系操作符","id":"跨-span-关系操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合与过滤函数","id":"聚合与过滤函数"},{"level":2,"text":"TraceQL Metrics：运行时指标","id":"traceql-metrics-运行时指标"},{"level":3,"text":"一阶聚合函数","id":"一阶聚合函数"},{"level":3,"text":"二阶函数与比较运算符","id":"二阶函数与比较运算符"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应采样（Tempo 3.0）","id":"自适应采样-tempo-3-0"},{"level":2,"text":"实战查询模式","id":"实战查询模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：错误链路定位","id":"模式一-错误链路定位"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：延迟热点分析","id":"模式二-延迟热点分析"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：服务依赖发现","id":"模式三-服务依赖发现"},{"level":3,"text":"模式四：最近错误快速查看","id":"模式四-最近错误快速查看"},{"level":2,"text":"Query Hint 与性能优化","id":"query-hint-与性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"追踪后端存储：Grafana Tempo 与 Jaeger","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/analysis/tracing-backends"},"next":{"title":"追踪可视化与分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/analysis/trace-visualization"}}